{"about_the_game":"Flipped On is a game about reaction, focus, and control. There are no unnecessary mechanics here. Just you and the gameplay.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEvery action must be precise. A mistake breaks your rhythm and sends you back to the start. The game speeds up quickly and constantly tests how well you can keep up.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhat awaits you:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Easy to get into, high difficulty<br />\r\nThe controls are clear from the start, but consistent results require skill.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Short and intense sessions<br />\r\nPerfect for quick runs that easily turn into a chain of attempts.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Constant pressure<br />\r\nThe speed increases, and there is less and less room for mistakes.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Pure gameplay<br />\r\nNo extra systems. Everything is built around reaction and precision.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- &quot;One more try&quot; effect<br />\r\nAfter each attempt, you want to start again immediately and do better.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"1048c3e46eeb5edc30569db91daa1436e2a20c86.jpg","localized_name":"Your first death","name":"Your first death","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/769910/1048c3e46eeb5edc30569db91daa1436e2a20c86.jpg"},{"icon":"336d7976a9cd7be7568b40a1a92e2c1426a1c0cb.jpg","localized_name":"You have completed Flipped On!","name":"You have completed Flipped On!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/769910/336d7976a9cd7be7568b40a1a92e2c1426a1c0cb.jpg"},{"icon":"603835a1f4efcdc12d567a62a0b39d3f0825a5c6.jpg","localized_name":"You have completed the first stage!","name":"You have completed the first stage!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/769910/603835a1f4efcdc12d567a62a0b39d3f0825a5c6.jpg"},{"icon":"6de33ca59356b3b8aaedf6192a05540c192564a4.jpg","localized_name":"You have damaged your car!","name":"You have damaged your car!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.stea